 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-AXIS                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-DIR                  BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-AXIS L-DIR.
     EVALUATE L-AXIS
         WHEN 0
             MOVE 4 TO L-DIR
         WHEN 1
             MOVE 0 TO L-DIR
         WHEN OTHER
             MOVE 2 TO L-DIR
     END-EVALUATE
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM F356-AXIS-NEGATIVE.

